        "original_id": "4b0b2e91-473d-5726-973f-5901115cd526",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Shows: The Celebrity Apprentice 3, The Apprentice 9, Celebrity Apprentice\n- Companies: NBC\n- People: Bret Michaels\n- Bands: Poison\n- Songs: Every Rose Has Its Thorn\n- Topics: television scheduling, music chart success\n\nFacts:\n- On April 29, 2009, NBC officially announced that Celebrity Apprentice would return for Spring 2010.\n- The Celebrity Apprentice 3, also known as The Apprentice 9, is the ninth installment of the reality game show Celebrity Apprentice.\n- The Celebrity Apprentice 3 premiered on Sunday, March 14, 2010.\n- On Sunday, May 23, 2010, the two-hour finale of The Celebrity Apprentice 3 aired from 9–11 p.m. ET/PT, and Bret Michaels won the season.\n- Bret Michael Sychak was born on March 15, 1963, and is professionally known as Bret Michaels.\n- Bret Michaels is an American singer-songwriter and musician.\n- Bret Michaels is the lead singer of Poison.\n- Poison charted ten singles in the Billboard Hot 100 Top 40, including six Top 10 singles and the number-one song Every Rose Has Its Thorn.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a73b6a19-b5d8-577a-a140-5bdbbfe01b77",
        "text": "Page: The Apprentice (U.S. season 9). Sentence: The Celebrity Apprentice 3 (also known as The Apprentice 9) is the ninth installment of the reality game show, \"Celebrity Apprentice\".\nPage: The Apprentice (U.S. season 9). Sentence: On April 29, 2009, NBC officially announced the renewal of \"Celebrity Apprentice\" for Spring 2010.\nPage: The Apprentice (U.S. season 9). Sentence: The show premiered on Sunday, March 14, 2010.\nPage: The Apprentice (U.S. season 9). Sentence: The two-hour season finale was on Sunday, May 23, 2010, 9–11 p.m., ET/PT and the winner was Poison lead singer and \"Rock of Love\" star Bret Michaels.\nPage: Bret Michaels. Sentence: Bret Michael Sychak (born March 15, 1963), professionally known as Bret Michaels, is an American singer-songwriter and musician.\nPage: Bret Michaels. Sentence: The band has also charted ten singles to the Top 40 of the \"Billboard\" Hot 100, including six Top 10 singles and a number-one single, \"Every Rose Has Its Thorn\".",
